{"year":"2026","sessionID":"2026GS","sessionIndex":"1","billNumber":"SB0152","billNumberShort":"S.B. 152","billNumberLong":"SB0152","fileNumber":"2026FL0780","shortTitle":"Public and Higher Education Collaboration","currentSubVersion":"0","currentMinVersion":"6","primeSponsor":"MCKELMK","primeSponsorName":"Sen. McKell, Michael K.","primeSponsorHouse":"S","floorSponsor":"PETERVL","floorSponsorName":"Rep. Peterson, Val L.","floorSponsorHouse":"H","generalProvisions":"This bill establishes a process for sharing grades 7through12 student data between public education and higher education.","highlightedProvisions":"This bill:<hr><ltbullet>establishes a data sharing process between state and higher education boards for grades 7 through 12 student data;<hr><ltbullet>authorizes disclosure to support college readiness programs and higher education access;<hr><ltbullet>requires compliance with federal privacy laws and state student data protections;<hr><ltbullet>mandates parent notification of opt-out rights for data sharing;<hr><ltbullet>requires training of higher education employees who will have data access; <hr><ltbullet>delegates rulemaking authority to the Board of Higher Education; and<hr><ltbullet>makes conforming changes. ","moniesAppropriated":"None","draftingAttorney":"Jeff Van Hulten","fiscalAnalyst":"Joseph Fitzgerald","lastAction":"Governor Signed","lastActionOwner":"Lieutenant Governor's office for filing","lastActionDate":"3/19/2026","trackingID":"DXYVPOIMQB","actionHistoryList":[{"description":"Bill Numbered but not Distributed","owner":"Legislative Research and General Counsel","actionDate":"2026-01-16 15:59:00.390","actionClass":"L","voteID":"","voiceVote":"","voteHouse":"","voteStr":"","actionCode":"LNUMBER","parm1":"","parm2":""},{"description":"Numbered Bill Publicly Distributed","owner":"Legislative Research and General Counsel","actionDate":"2026-01-16 15:59:00.390","actionClass":"L","voteID":"","voiceVote":"","voteHouse":"","voteStr":"","actionCode":